        "summary": "Wearable Devices Ltd. launched ai6 Labs, a neural AI ecosystem designed to bridge the gap between human intent and machine execution, particularly as AI evolves beyond generative chat into autonomous action. The core of ai6 Labs is the Large MUAP Model (LMM), a proprietary neural AI framework that interprets electromyographic signals, aiming to create a \"digital nervous system\" linking human intention to AI-driven action. This initiative positions Wearable Devices as a foundational infrastructure provider for the autonomous AI era, offering solutions that enhance AI technologies from companies like Alphabet, Meta, Apple, and NVIDIA.",
