        "url": "https://newsroom.cisco.com/c/r/newsroom/en/us/a/y2026/m02/cisco-announces-new-silicon-one-g300.html",
        "time_published": "20260214T105544",
        "authors": [],
        "summary": "Cisco has unveiled its new Silicon One G300 102.4 Tbps switching silicon, along with advanced N9000 and 8000 systems and optics, designed to power and scale AI data centers. These innovations aim to improve energy efficiency by nearly 70%, lower operating costs, and simplify operations for hyperscalers, neoclouds, service providers, and enterprises building AI infrastructure. The G300, which features Intelligent Collective Networking, is expected to enhance network utilization by 33% and reduce AI job completion time by 28%.",
