        "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/technology/tech-news/analyst-bets-google-will-beat-nvidia-to-become-worlds-most-valuable-company-in-2026-and-the-reason-is-linked-to-tech-companies-big-headache/articleshow/128344489.cms",
        "time_published": "20260214T162100",
        "authors": [
            "TOI Tech Desk"
        ],
        "summary": "An analyst predicts Google could surpass Nvidia to become the world's most valuable company by market capitalization by late 2026. This is attributed to Google's broad AI platform, in-house chips like TPUs, and strong growth in search and cloud, positioning it favorably against the rising costs and constraints of AI computing infrastructure that currently challenges the tech industry. The analyst suggests that investor perception of Google's AI leadership has shifted, particularly after initial concerns about ChatGPT's impact on Google Search proved incorrect.",
